\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Without warmup, training stalls almost immediately. Training loss for the four configurations and the follow-up control (mean over 3{} seeds; shaded: range over seeds). With warmup, the two mean curves nearly coincide after early training; the shaded bands show brief loss spikes in single seeds. The capped no-ramp control improves slowly and solves the task in 1{} of 3{} seeds.}}{3}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:loss}{{2}{3}{Without warmup, training stalls almost immediately. Training loss for the four configurations and the follow-up control (mean over \valSeeds {} seeds; shaded: range over seeds). With warmup, the two mean curves nearly coincide after early training; the shaded bands show brief loss spikes in single seeds. The capped no-ramp control improves slowly and solves the task in \valRampSolved {} of \valRampRuns {} seeds}{figure.2}{}}
